  },
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A particle of mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>moves in a straight line with retardation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is the displacement in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>SI</mi></math> units. Its loss of kinetic energy for above displacement is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;The value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi></math>&nbsp;will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Acceleration can be written as,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>.</p><p>Given:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></math>(-ve sign is due to retardation)</p><p>Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Integrating both sides, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>&#916;</mi><mi>K</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>|</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>"
  }
}